	<metadata>
		<name>Southwest National Parks 2026 - Park to Park, Pinnacles to Sunset Bay</name>
		<desc>Park waypoints only, in the order visited. No gas stops, no hotels. Provided as-is, no warranty. GandalfDDI.</desc>
	</metadata>
